From 39fa50f70d98660bf32c3ec4e71fdac55dfb0d82 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Stream video uploads end to end (RNF-01)

nginx no longer buffers request bodies; the gateway pipes the video to
projects without multer; projects writes it to a temporary file, checks
the profile limit before and while reading, probes and hashes it from
disk and streams it to storage; storage uploads it to S3 in parts.
The frontend shows upload progress. Adds regression tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
